      "text": "When does a fear of the dark typically start and end?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 12,
      "heading_id": "heading_00003",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "What can you do about your toddler's fear of the dark?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 14,
      "heading_id": "heading_00004",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Acknowledge the fear"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 17,
      "heading_id": "heading_00005",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Stay in bed and keep the lights off"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 20,
      "heading_id": "heading_00006",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Play in the dark"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 22,
      "heading_id": "heading_00007",
